\ Decision 40: the level tables (trigger_points_x_low_table .. new_helicopter_types) are in moved_0a20
\ (after its code), the mover type tables and player_helicopter_types_vertical_speed .. player_helicopters_
\ initial_x_high in HAZEL (hazel_b). What stays is placed by its reads (measured: every indexed read's
\ base and address on passbench's two games):
\ the scenery tables first, then movers_firing_cooldown and the unflipped mover sprite addresses, the
\ movers run page-aligned (no read of it crosses a page, its &FF read of movers_type_and_colour
\ included), then the flipped mover sprite addresses.

